        &lt;span class="p"&gt;)&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;)&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;}&lt;/span&gt;
      &lt;span class="o"&gt;&amp;lt;/&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="nc"&gt;Flex&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="o"&gt;&amp;gt;&lt;/span&gt;

      &lt;span class="o"&gt;&amp;lt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="nc"&gt;Flex&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="n"&gt;gap&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="o"&gt;=&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;{&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="mi"&gt;8&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;}&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="o"&gt;&amp;gt;&lt;/span&gt;
        &lt;span class="o"&gt;&amp;lt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="nc"&gt;Aside&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="n"&gt;width&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="o"&gt;=&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;{&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="mi"&gt;56&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;}&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="n"&gt;flexShrink&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="o"&gt;=&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;{&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="mi"&gt;0&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;}&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="o"&gt;&amp;gt;&lt;/span&gt;
          &lt;span class="o"&gt;&amp;lt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="nc"&gt;Ul&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="o"&gt;&amp;gt;&lt;/span&gt;
            &lt;span class="p"&gt;{&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="n"&gt;days&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="nf"&gt;map&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;(&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;(&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="n"&gt;day&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;)&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="o"&gt;=&amp;gt;&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="p"&gt;(&lt;/span&gt;
              &lt;span class="o"&gt;&amp;lt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="nc"&gt;Li&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="n"&gt;key&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="o"&gt;=&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;{&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="n"&gt;day&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;}&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="o"&gt;&amp;gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;{&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="n"&gt;day&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;}&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="o"&gt;&amp;lt;/&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="nc"&gt;Li&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="o"&gt;&amp;gt;&lt;/span&gt;
            &lt;span class="p"&gt;)&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;)&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;}&lt;/span&gt;
          &lt;span class="o"&gt;&amp;lt;/&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="nc"&gt;Ul&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="o"&gt;&amp;gt;&lt;/span&gt;
        &lt;span class="o"&gt;&amp;lt;/&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="nc"&gt;Aside&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="o"&gt;&amp;gt;&lt;/span&gt;

        &lt;span class="o"&gt;&amp;lt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="nc"&gt;Box&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="o"&gt;&amp;gt;&lt;/span&gt;
          &lt;span class="o"&gt;&amp;lt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="no"&gt;H1&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="n"&gt;fontSize&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="o"&gt;=&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;{&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="mi"&gt;32&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;}&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="n"&gt;fontWeight&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="o"&gt;=&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;{&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="mi"&gt;700&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;}&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="n"&gt;mb&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="o"&gt;=&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;{&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="mi"&gt;4&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;}&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="o"&gt;&amp;gt;&lt;/span&gt;
            &lt;span class="nc"&gt;Ten&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="n"&gt;days&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="k"&gt;in&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="nc"&gt;Portugal&lt;/span&gt;
          &lt;span class="o"&gt;&amp;lt;/&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="no"&gt;H1&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="o"&gt;&amp;gt;&lt;/span&gt;
          &lt;span class="o"&gt;&amp;lt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="nc"&gt;Img&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="n"&gt;props&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="o"&gt;=&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;{&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;{&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="n"&gt;src&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;:&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="n"&gt;photo&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;,&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="n"&gt;alt&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;:&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="s1"&gt;'The coast near Lagos'&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="p"&gt;}&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;}&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="n"&gt;mb&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="o"&gt;=&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;{&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="mi"&gt;4&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;}&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="o"&gt;/&amp;gt;&lt;/span&gt;
          &lt;span class="o"&gt;&amp;lt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="no"&gt;P&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="o"&gt;&amp;gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="nc"&gt;Tickets&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;:&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="n"&gt;https&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="c1"&gt;//www.example.com/bookings/PT2026LISBONSINTRALAGOSK7Q2M9X4R8T1W6Z3N5V8B2C4&amp;lt;/P&amp;gt;&lt;/span&gt;
        &lt;span class="o"&gt;&amp;lt;/&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="nc"&gt;Box&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="o"&gt;&amp;gt;&lt;/span&gt;
      &lt;span class="o"&gt;&amp;lt;/&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="nc"&gt;Flex&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="o"&gt;&amp;gt;&lt;/span&gt;
    &lt;span class="o"&gt;&amp;lt;/&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="nc"&gt;Box&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="o"&gt;&amp;gt;&lt;/span&gt;
  &lt;span class="p"&gt;)&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;;&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;span class="p"&gt;}&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;

&lt;/div&gt;



&lt;p&gt;A row of links (indigo, and a lighter indigo in dark mode), a sidebar with a fixed width (&lt;code&gt;width={56}&lt;/code&gt; is 224 pixels, because spacing is on a scale of four), and a story with a photo and a booking link. On a wide laptop screen most of it looks fine. Every part of it is a real cause of a page that scrolls sideways.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href="https://media2.dev.to/dynamic/image/width=800%2Cheight=%2Cfit=scale-down%2Cgravity=auto%2Cformat=auto/https%3A%2F%2Fwww.box-kite.dev%2Fimg%2Fblog%2Fa-layout-that-works-on-every-screen%2Fstarting-page.png" class="article-body-image-wrapper"&gt;&lt;img src="https://media2.dev.to/dynamic/image/width=800%2Cheight=%2Cfit=scale-down%2Cgravity=auto%2Cformat=auto/https%3A%2F%2Fwww.box-kite.dev%2Fimg%2Fblog%2Fa-layout-that-works-on-every-screen%2Fstarting-page.png" alt="The starting page: the sidebar keeps its width, and the photo runs past the edge of the frame."&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;h2&gt;


  Step 2: look at it the way a phone does
&lt;/h2&gt;

&lt;p&gt;You do not need a phone yet. Open your browser's developer tools (F12, or Cmd+Option+I on a Mac) and turn on the device toolbar: Ctrl+Shift+M, or Cmd+Shift+M on a Mac, in Chrome and Edge, and "Responsive Design Mode" in Firefox and Safari. Pick a phone such as the iPhone 12 Pro, which is 390 pixels wide.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;The page now scrolls sideways: drag it left and the photo and the booking link keep going. That sideways scroll is the bug. A phone shows the page at its own width only because Vite's &lt;code&gt;index.html&lt;/code&gt; already carries the &lt;code&gt;&amp;lt;meta name="viewport"&amp;gt;&lt;/code&gt; line; keep it.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;h2&gt;


  Step 3: find what is too wide
&lt;/h2&gt;

&lt;p&gt;Open the Console tab of the developer tools, paste this and press Enter:&lt;br&gt;
&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;div class="highlight js-code-highlight"&gt;
&lt;pre class="highlight javascript"&gt;&lt;code&gt;&lt;span class="nb"&gt;document&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="nf"&gt;querySelectorAll&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;(&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="s1"&gt;'body *'&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;)&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="nf"&gt;forEach&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;(&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;(&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="n"&gt;el&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;)&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="o"&gt;=&amp;gt;&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="p"&gt;{&lt;/span&gt;
  &lt;span class="k"&gt;if&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="p"&gt;(&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="n"&gt;el&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="nf"&gt;getBoundingClientRect&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;(&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;)&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="n"&gt;right&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="o"&gt;&amp;gt;&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="n"&gt;innerWidth&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="o"&gt;||&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="n"&gt;el&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="n"&gt;scrollWidth&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="o"&gt;&amp;gt;&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="n"&gt;el&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="n"&gt;clientWidth&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;)&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="n"&gt;el&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="n"&gt;style&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="n"&gt;outline&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="o"&gt;=&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="s1"&gt;'2px solid red'&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;;&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;span class="p"&gt;}&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;)&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;;&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;

&lt;/div&gt;



&lt;p&gt;Every element that runs past the right edge of the screen, or whose content runs past its own edge, gets a red outline. The outer boxes light up because something inside them is too wide; look for the innermost red box and you have found the culprit. On this page there are three: the row of links, the sidebar with its photo beside it, and the booking link. Reload the page to clear the outlines.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;h2&gt;


  Step 4: let the row of links wrap
&lt;/h2&gt;

&lt;p&gt;A row keeps everything on one line unless you tell it otherwise. Add &lt;code&gt;flexWrap="wrap"&lt;/code&gt; to the first &lt;code&gt;Flex&lt;/code&gt;, so the links that do not fit move to a second line:&lt;br&gt;
&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;div class="highlight js-code-highlight"&gt;
&lt;pre class="highlight tsx"&gt;&lt;code&gt;&lt;span class="k"&gt;import&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="nc"&gt;Box&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="k"&gt;from&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="s1"&gt;'@box-kite/react'&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;;&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;span class="k"&gt;import&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="nc"&gt;Flex&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="k"&gt;from&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="s1"&gt;'@box-kite/react/components/flex'&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;;&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;span class="k"&gt;import&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="p"&gt;{&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="nc"&gt;Aside&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;,&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="no"&gt;H1&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;,&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="nc"&gt;Img&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;,&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="nc"&gt;Li&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;,&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="nc"&gt;Link&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;,&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="no"&gt;P&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;,&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="nc"&gt;Ul&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="p"&gt;}&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="k"&gt;from&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="s1"&gt;'@box-kite/react/components/semantics'&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;;&lt;/span&gt;

