&lt;p&gt;At phone width the days now sit above the story. Switch the device toolbar to a laptop size and they move back beside it. Without &lt;code&gt;flexShrink: 0&lt;/code&gt; the sidebar came out at 103 pixels instead of 193 on an 820-pixel screen.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;h2&gt;


  Step 6: let the photo shrink
&lt;/h2&gt;

&lt;p&gt;A picture is as wide as its file unless you say otherwise, and this one is 1,200 pixels. &lt;code&gt;maxWidth="fit"&lt;/code&gt; caps it at the width of its column (&lt;code&gt;fit&lt;/code&gt; is 100%), and &lt;code&gt;height="auto"&lt;/code&gt; keeps its proportions as it shrinks:&lt;br&gt;
